      "message": "The results for different resolutions are as follows for commit [2225df7](https://aomedia.googlesource.com/aom/+/2225df767d91c1447839283e910fcad03ffa650a):\n```\n                Encoder Instruction                              BD-Rate Loss (%)\ncpu  Resolution  Count Reduction(%) avg.psnr   ovr.psnr     ssim      vmaf    vmaf_neg\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3    LOWRES2         0.78            0.0293     0.0373    -0.0930   -0.0130   0.0001\n3    MIDRES2         1.36            0.0247     0.0143     0.0277    0.0962   0.0789\n3    SHORTS608p      0.94            0.0018    -0.0048     0.0038    0.0094  -0.0017\n3    SHORTS720p      1.19            0.0443     0.0236     0.0260   -0.0244  -0.0039\n3    SHORTS1080p     1.42            0.0354     0.0393     0.0596    0.0904   0.1124\n3    HDRES2          2.40            0.0808     0.0772     0.0565    0.0235   0.0848\n3    Average         1.33            0.0348     0.0296     0.0444    0.0304   0.0433\n```\n\n\n\n\nThe instruction count reduction specified has been measured using command:\n```\n`$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc`\n```\nPlease note that the above result is generated by excluding the few clips which show non-monotonic behavior in BD-Rate curves for reference commit. \n\nPlease review.",
